<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS3" title="In 4. Evaluation ‣ X-Cross: Dynamic Integration of Language Models for Cross-Domain Sequential Recommendation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.3 </span>Efficiency on Limited Training Data</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS4" title="In 4. Evaluation ‣ X-Cross: Dynamic Integration of Language Models for Cross-Domain Sequential Recommendation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.4 </span>Impact of Number of Model Layers</span></a></li>
